{"content_hash": "1e0e0c7e835adc11", "version_id": 433, "article_id": 44, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Fury vs Joshua tickets sell out in one hour", "title_zh": "富里对约书亚门票一小时售罄", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "bbc_sport", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/boxing/articles/cwp9gxzyplk4o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1788550545592-7e07d7846c76?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8ZnVyeSUyMHNwb3J0cyUyMGFjdGlvbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkxNTk0NTEyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Daniel Delgado on Unsplash", "author": "Daniel Delgado", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@dannyd_91?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-grappling-in-jiu-jitsu-academy-x4A1siYHags?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(296, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(334, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "14d85ff3aedb"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-09", "word_count": 191, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "Tickets for the boxing fight between Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua sold out in just one hour. The most expensive seats cost over £13,000, and the event will be shown live on Netflix.", "lead_zh": "泰森·富里和安东尼·约书亚的拳击比赛门票一小时内就卖光了。最贵的票超过1.3万英镑，比赛将在Netflix上直播。", "preview": "Tickets for the heavyweight fight between Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua sold out in just one hour. Around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:", "preview_zh": "泰森·富里和安东尼·约书亚的重量级拳击比赛门票一小时内就卖光了。周五英国夏令时12点，大约8万张门票开始发售，超过50万人在网上排队等待。票价最低88.50英镑，但最贵的门票加上手续费高达13128英镑。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 423, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/44/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 86.688, "size_bytes": 523872, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 222, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fc48a26/content/data/versions/433.json", "paragraphs": ["Tickets for the heavyweight fight between Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua sold out in just one hour. Around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:00 BST on Friday, and more than 500,000 people waited in the online queue. Prices started at £88.50, but the most expensive tickets cost £13,128, including fees.", "The fight will take place at Cardiff's Principality Stadium. The event begins on 11 December, but the boxers are not expected to fight until the early hours of 12 December. Ringwalks will start around 01:00 GMT, and the stadium will stay open until 03:30.", "Although the fight was announced in September, there was uncertainty just 11 days ago about whether it would happen. This was because of a dispute over the role of UFC chief Dana White. However, the British rivals met at a news conference on 30 September to promote the fight.", "Tickets quickly appeared on resale websites. Ringside VIP seats were advertised for £73,645, while upper tier seats were available for £425. The event is a collaboration between Saudi boxing powerbroker Turki Alalshikh's The Ring and UFC chief Dana White. Organisers have not yet confirmed any undercard fights."], "paragraphs_zh": ["泰森·富里和安东尼·约书亚的重量级拳击比赛门票一小时内就卖光了。周五英国夏令时12点，大约8万张门票开始发售，超过50万人在网上排队等待。票价最低88.50英镑，但最贵的门票加上手续费高达13128英镑。", "比赛将在加的夫的公国体育场举行。活动从12月11日开始，但预计两位拳手要到12月12日凌晨才会开打。拳手入场大约在格林尼治时间凌晨1点开始，体育场会开放到凌晨3点30分。", "虽然比赛在9月就宣布了，但就在11天前，由于UFC总裁达纳·怀特的角色争议，比赛能否举行还不确定。不过，这两位英国对手在9月30日的新闻发布会上见面，为比赛造势。", "门票很快出现在转售网站上。场边VIP座位标价73645英镑，而上层看台座位也要425英镑。这场比赛是沙特拳击经纪人图尔基·阿拉尔希赫的《拳台》杂志和UFC总裁达纳·怀特合作推广的。组织者尚未确认任何垫场赛。"], "body": "Tickets for the heavyweight fight between Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua sold out in just one hour. Around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:00 BST on Friday, and more than 500,000 people waited in the online queue. Prices started at £88.50, but the most expensive tickets cost £13,128, including fees.\n\nThe fight will take place at Cardiff's Principality Stadium. The event begins on 11 December, but the boxers are not expected to fight until the early hours of 12 December. Ringwalks will start around 01:00 GMT, and the stadium will stay open until 03:30.\n\nAlthough the fight was announced in September, there was uncertainty just 11 days ago about whether it would happen. This was because of a dispute over the role of UFC chief Dana White. However, the British rivals met at a news conference on 30 September to promote the fight.\n\nTickets quickly appeared on resale websites. Ringside VIP seats were advertised for £73,645, while upper tier seats were available for £425. The event is a collaboration between Saudi boxing powerbroker Turki Alalshikh's The Ring and UFC chief Dana White. Organisers have not yet confirmed any undercard fights.", "body_zh": "泰森·富里和安东尼·约书亚的重量级拳击比赛门票一小时内就卖光了。周五英国夏令时12点，大约8万张门票开始发售，超过50万人在网上排队等待。票价最低88.50英镑，但最贵的门票加上手续费高达13128英镑。\n\n比赛将在加的夫的公国体育场举行。活动从12月11日开始，但预计两位拳手要到12月12日凌晨才会开打。拳手入场大约在格林尼治时间凌晨1点开始，体育场会开放到凌晨3点30分。\n\n虽然比赛在9月就宣布了，但就在11天前，由于UFC总裁达纳·怀特的角色争议，比赛能否举行还不确定。不过，这两位英国对手在9月30日的新闻发布会上见面，为比赛造势。\n\n门票很快出现在转售网站上。场边VIP座位标价73645英镑，而上层看台座位也要425英镑。这场比赛是沙特拳击经纪人图尔基·阿拉尔希赫的《拳台》杂志和UFC总裁达纳·怀特合作推广的。组织者尚未确认任何垫场赛。", "text": "Tickets for the heavyweight fight between Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua sold out in just one hour. Around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:00 BST on Friday, and more than 500,000 people waited in the online queue. Prices started at £88.50, but the most expensive tickets cost £13,128, including fees. The fight will take place at Cardiff's Principality Stadium. The event begins on 11 December, but the boxers are not expected to fight until the early hours of 12 December. Ringwalks will start around 01:00 GMT, and the stadium will stay open until 03:30. Although the fight was announced in September, there was uncertainty just 11 days ago about whether it would happen. This was because of a dispute over the role of UFC chief Dana White. However, the British rivals met at a news conference on 30 September to promote the fight. Tickets quickly appeared on resale websites. Ringside VIP seats were advertised for £73,645, while upper tier seats were available for £425. The event is a collaboration between Saudi boxing powerbroker Turki Alalshikh's The Ring and UFC chief Dana White. Organisers have not yet confirmed any undercard fights.", "vocab": [{"word": "heavyweight", "pos": "noun", "zh": "重量级（拳击）", "note": "指体重最重的拳击级别"}, {"word": "sell out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "售罄", "note": "常用短语，表示门票等全部卖完"}, {"word": "queue", "pos": "noun", "zh": "队列，排队", "note": "online queue 指网上排队"}, {"word": "including fees", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "包含手续费", "note": "说明价格已含额外费用"}, {"word": "ringwalk", "pos": "noun", "zh": "拳手入场", "note": "拳击比赛中拳手走向擂台的环节"}, {"word": "uncertainty", "pos": "noun", "zh": "不确定性", "note": "指事情能否发生还不确定"}, {"word": "dispute", "pos": "noun", "zh": "争议，纠纷", "note": "常指双方意见不合"}, {"word": "resale", "pos": "noun", "zh": "转售", "note": "resale website 指转卖门票的网站"}, {"word": "collaboration", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合作", "note": "指双方一起做某事"}, {"word": "undercard", "pos": "noun", "zh": "垫场赛", "note": "主赛之前的其他比赛"}], "title_original": "Fury-Joshua tickets priced up to £13,000 sell out in one hour", "summary_original": "Tickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's fight at Cardiff's Principality Stadium sells out in just one hour.", "body_original": "Fury-Joshua tickets priced up to £13,000 sell out in one hour\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nTickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's fight at Cardiff's Principality Stadium have sold out in just one hour.\nFury and Joshua will meet on a bill that begins on 11 December but they are not expected to fight until the early hours of 12 December.\nThe highest-priced tickets were available at £13,128, including booking fees, with the lowest at £88.50.\nThe all-British heavyweight contest, which will be broadcast globally on Netflix, was\nannounced in September\nand around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:00 BST on Friday.\nJust minutes after the tickets went on sale more than 500,000 people were waiting in the online queue.\nTickets quickly began emerging on resale websites, with ringside VIP seats being advertised for £73,645, while upper tier seats were available for £425.\nRingwalks are\nexpected to start around 01:00 GMT\non Saturday 12 December, following a short live music performance, and the stadium will remain open until 03:30.\nThe event is being promoted as a collaboration between Saudi boxing powerbroker Turki Alalshikh's The Ring and UFC chief Dana White.\nOrganisers are yet to confirm any of the undercard fights.\nWhat information do we collect from this quiz?\nJoshua, 36, and Fury, 38 - both former two-time world champions - signed contracts for the bout earlier this year, but the date and venue had yet to be confirmed.\nLondon's Wembley Stadium and New York's Madison Square Garden were the frontrunners to stage the fight, but both presented issues before Cardiff emerged as an alternative.\nThe Principality Stadium has hosted late-night boxing before, including Joe Calzaghe's fight with Mikkel Kessler in November 2007, which began at 01:00 GMT.\nRicky Hatton's victory over Kostya Tszyu at Manchester's MEN Arena in 2005 began at about 02:00 local time, allowing US broadcaster Showtime to show the fight on Saturday evening.\nJust 11 days ago, there was uncertainty over whether the fight would even take place due to a dispute over the role of UFC chief White in the promotion of the event.\nBroadcaster Netflix said Alalshikh's The Ring and White would collaborate to promote the event, but Joshua's promoter Eddie Hearn said his fighter's contract prevented White from having a promotional role.\nThe British rivals finally met at a news conference on 30 September to begin the build-up to one of the most anticipated fights in British history.\nFury and Joshua are reported to be sharing a purse worth close to $200m (£151m)\nRelated topics\nBoxing\nBoxing schedule and results 2026\nPublished\n1 day ago\nWatch every Born to Brawl episode\nPublished\n28 April 2024\nMore boxing from the BBC\nNotifications, social media and more with BBC Sport\nPublished\n28 August", "fetched_at": "2026-10-10T01:08:30.325164", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Tickets", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.525, "sm": 100, "em": 525, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "for", "s": 0.537, "e": 0.65, "sm": 537, "em": 650, "cs": 8, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "the", "s": 0.662, "e": 0.725, "sm": 662, "em": 725, "cs": 12, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "heavyweight", "s": 0.738, "e": 1.275, "sm": 737, "em": 1275, "cs": 16, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "fight", "s": 1.288, "e": 1.625, "sm": 1287, "em": 1625, "cs": 28, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "between", "s": 1.637, "e": 2.0, "sm": 1637, "em": 2000, "cs": 34, "ce": 41, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "Tyson", "s": 2.013, "e": 2.438, "sm": 2012, "em": 2437, "cs": 42, "ce": 47, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "Fury", "s": 2.45, "e": 2.913, "sm": 2450, "em": 2912, "cs": 48, "ce": 52, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "and", "s": 2.925, "e": 3.087, "sm": 2925, "em": 3087, "cs": 53, "ce": 56, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "Anthony", "s": 3.1, "e": 3.488, "sm": 3100, "em": 3487, "cs": 57, "ce": 64, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "Joshua", "s": 3.5, "e": 4.013, "sm": 3500, "em": 4012, "cs": 65, "ce": 71, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "sold", "s": 4.025, "e": 4.338, "sm": 4025, "em": 4337, "cs": 72, "ce": 76, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "out", "s": 4.35, "e": 4.575, "sm": 4350, "em": 4574, "cs": 77, "ce": 80, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "in", "s": 4.588, "e": 4.725, "sm": 4587, "em": 4725, "cs": 81, "ce": 83, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "just", "s": 4.737, "e": 5.0, "sm": 4737, "em": 5000, "cs": 84, "ce": 88, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": "one", "s": 5.013, "e": 5.213, "sm": 5012, "em": 5212, "cs": 89, "ce": 92, "si": 0}, {"i": 16, "w": "hour", "s": 5.225, "e": 5.637, "sm": 5225, "em": 5637, "cs": 93, "ce": 97